🐛 COMMON ISSUES
Issue 1: fatal: pathspec 'backend/.env' did not match any files
Matlab: .env pehle se git me nahi hai. Skip karo:

powershell
git rm --cached frontend/.env
Issue 2: .env phir bhi git status me dikh rahi hai
Matlab: .gitignore me spelling mistake hai.

powershell
type .gitignore
.env exact aisa hona chahiye (bina space, bina slash).

Issue 3: README GitHub pe update nahi hua
Matlab: Commit nahi hua ya push nahi hua.

powershell
git log --oneline -5
Latest commit dikhna chahiye.

Issue 4: Authentication failed
Personal Access Token use karo (password ki jagah).

🎬 AB YEH KARO (In Order)
✅ Task 1: README Edit Karo
powershell
cd C:\Users\HP\ai-decision-audit-agent
notepad README.md
Purana content delete karo

Naya content paste karo (jo maine diya)

Ctrl+S (SAVE!) — ⚠️ Ye step bhoolna mat

Close notepad

✅ Task 2: Verify Kiya?
powershell
type README.md
Content dikhna chahiye (badges, tables, etc.)

✅ Task 3: .gitignore Update Karo
powershell
notepad .gitignore
.env add karo, save karo.

✅ Task 4: Push Karo
powershell
git rm --cached backend/.env frontend/.env
git add .
git commit -m "docs: add comprehensive README + security: ignore .env"
git push
