README.md me content save hua? (type README.md chala ke batao)

.gitignore me .env add kiya?

Push hua? Screenshot ya output paste karo

Main wait kar raha hoon. Ek-ek step karo, batao. Fir backend code pe jayenge. 💪

Yaad rakho: Interview me README bahut important hai. Recruiter sabse pehle yehi dekhta hai. Isliye sahi se karna. 🔥

gigitnore fiel
📄 .gitignore File — Complete Content (Copy-Paste Ready)
Bhai, ye lo complete .gitignore file. Isse copy karke apni .gitignore file me paste kar do.

✅ Kaise Use Karein:
Project folder me jao: C:\Users\HP\ai-decision-audit-agent

Terminal me chalao:

powershell
notepad .gitignore
Pura purana content delete karo (Ctrl+A → Delete)

Neeche wala content paste karo (Ctrl+V)

Save karo (Ctrl+S)

Close karo

📋 .gitignore CONTENT (Copy From Here ⬇️)
gitignore
# ============================================
# AI Decision Audit Agent - .gitignore
# ============================================

# --------------------------------------------
# 🔐 ENVIRONMENT FILES (CRITICAL - NEVER PUSH)
# --------------------------------------------
.env
.env.local
.env.development
.env.production
.env.test
.env.*.local
backend/.env
frontend/.env
*.env
!.env.example
!backend/.env.example
!frontend/.env.example

# --------------------------------------------
# 🐍 PYTHON
# --------------------------------------------
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
develop-eggs/
dist/
downloads/
eggs/
.eggs/
lib/
lib64/
parts/
sdist/
var/
wheels/
share/python-wheels/
*.egg-info/
.installed.cfg
*.egg
MANIFEST

# Virtual Environments
venv/
ENV/
env/
.venv/
backend/venv/
backend/env/
backend/.venv/

# Python Testing
.pytest_cache/
.tox/
.nox/
.coverage
.coverage.*
.cache
htmlcov/
nosetests.xml
coverage.xml
*.cover
*.py,cover
.hypothesis/
.pytest_cache/

# Python Type Checking
.mypy_cache/
.dmypy.json
dmypy.json
.pyre/
.pytype/

# Python Linting
.ruff_cache/
.flake8

# --------------------------------------------
# 🗄️ DATABASES (LOCAL ONLY)
# --------------------------------------------
*.sqlite3
*.sqlite3-journal
*.sqlite3-wal
*.sqlite3-shm
*.db
*.db-journal
backend/data/*.sqlite3
backend/data/*.db

# Keep database folder structure
!backend/data/.gitkeep
!database/backups/.gitkeep

# --------------------------------------------
# 📦 NODE / REACT / FRONTEND
# --------------------------------------------
node_modules/
frontend/node_modules/
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
lerna-debug.log*
.npm
.yarn/
.pnp
.pnp.js

# Frontend builds
frontend/dist/
frontend/build/
frontend/.vite/
frontend/.cache/
dist-ssr/
*.local

# Vite
.vite/
vite.config.js.timestamp-*
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*

# --------------------------------------------
# 🔨 BUILD OUTPUTS
# --------------------------------------------
build/
dist/
out/
target/
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.class

